Probefläche GUAN_012 sind Gymnanthes lucida und Thouinia striata var. portoricensis dokumentiert.","answer_en":"Water availability shapes the habitat. Gymnanthes lucida and Thouinia striata var. portoricensis were recorded on rocky plot GUAN_012.","source_citations":[{"label":"NEON · Guánica Forest","url":"https://www.neonscience.org/field-sites/guan"},{"label":"NEON · GUAN_012","url":"https://data.neonscience.org/documents/10179/2361410/GUAN_PedonDescription_2018-11-15/0224d08c-8444-d29f-d2d4-6b131485f670?version=1.0"}],"station_slug":"guanica-yaiti"},{"id":"topsoil","min_zoom":12,"label_de":"Oberboden","label_en":"Topsoil","question_de":"Was finden die Wurzeln im Boden?","question_en":"What do roots find in the soil?","answer_de":"Am zweiten Untersuchungsort durchziehen feine und mittelstarke Wurzeln die oberen 30 cm eines krümeligen, tonigen Lehmbodens.","answer_en":"At a second survey location, fine and medium roots run through the upper 30 cm of granular clay loam.","source_citations":[{"label":"NEON · S2015PR055001","url":"https://www.neonscience.org/data-collection/soils/soil-descriptions/guan"}],"station_slug":"guanica-oberboden"},{"id":"subsoil","min_zoom":18,"label_de":"Unterboden","label_en":"Subsoil","question_de":"Warum ist der Boden hier alkalisch?","question_en":"Why is this soil alkaline?","answer_de":"Das Ausgangsmaterial enthält Kalkstein und Schluffstein. Im Horizont von 30–55 cm sind Karbonatanreicherungen und ein pH-Wert von 8,0 dokumentiert.","answer_en":"The parent material includes limestone and siltstone. Carbonate accumulations and pH 8.0 are documented in the 30–55 cm horizon.","source_citations":[{"label":"NEON · S2015PR055001","url":"https://www.neonscience.org/data-collection/soils/soil-descriptions/guan"}],"station_slug":"guanica-unterboden"}]'::jsonb), updated_at = now()
